{"id":"0f6cdd1b3e994e97","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points.md","title":"join与normal分层关系的最小不动点","display":"thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points — join与normal分层关系的最小不动点","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points","aliases":["56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points"],"display":"thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points — join与normal分层关系的最小不动点","depends_on":["[[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]]"],"source_section":"§3.5 Exercise 3.5.6(iii)","source_printed_pages":"84","source_statement_status":"source-exercise-compared; local-proof-supplied","source_proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points — join与normal分层关系的最小不动点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" href=\"?note=b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" title=\"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite\">56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.5 Exercise 3.5.6(iii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"84"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-exercise-compared; local-proof-supplied"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" href=\"?note=b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" title=\"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite\">56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,V,T,\\mathcal C,U_{\\mathcal C},\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m},Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}\">\\(\\Sigma,V,T,\\mathcal C,U_{\\mathcal C},\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m},Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}\\)</span>；所有条件列表有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\{1,2\\}\">\\(m\\in\\{1,2\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_m\">\\(Z_m\\)</span> 为该模式各层关系的并；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(T^2)\">\\(\\mathcal P(T^2)\\)</span> 是关系的幂集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Z_m\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Z_m\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal P(T^2)\\;\n\\bigl(X\\subseteq Y\\Rightarrow\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(X)\\subseteq\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(Y)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal P(T^2)\\;\n\\bigl(X\\subseteq Y\\Rightarrow\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(X)\\subseteq\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(Y)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nY_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}\\subseteq Y_{\\mathcal C,n+1}^{m}\\subseteq U_{\\mathcal C},\n\\qquad\n\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(Z_m)=Z_m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nY_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}\\subseteq Y_{\\mathcal C,n+1}^{m}\\subseteq U_{\\mathcal C},\n\\qquad\n\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(Z_m)=Z_m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall W\\in\\mathcal P(T^2)\\;\n\\bigl(\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(W)\\subseteq W\\Rightarrow Z_m\\subseteq W\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall W\\in\\mathcal P(T^2)\\;\n\\bigl(\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(W)\\subseteq W\\Rightarrow Z_m\\subseteq W\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Exercise 3.5.6(iii)（印刷第84页）要求对normal和join类证明相应结论。本地证明如下。有限步可达关系随底层关系单调，两个有限可达见证组成的join条件也单调；因此Φ单调，从空关系归纳得各层递增。任何条件步删去条件后都是同一规则、位置和替换的无条件步，故每层包含于U。</p>\n<p>若某一步属于Φ(Z)，每个条件只需一个有限归约见证，或两个到共同后继的有限见证；有限条件列表的全部见证仅使用有限多个Z中的边。每条边属于某个有限层，取这些层指标的最大值即可将全部条件放入同一层。故Φ(Z)包含于Z。反向每个非零层是前一层的像，利用单调性得Z包含于Φ(Z)。最后由Φ(W)包含于W，从空关系归纳得所有层包含于W。证明没有要求条件系统合流或终止，也没有把有限层测试当作一般证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"b1c8fb0e112e49fa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"b1c8fb0e112e49fa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,T,\\mathcal C,U_{\\mathcal C},\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m},Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}$；所有条件列表有限，$m\\in\\{1,2\\}$。$Z_m$ 为该模式各层关系的并；$\\mathcal P(T^2)$ 是关系的幂集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,V,T,\\mathcal C,U_{\\mathcal C},\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m},Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\{1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Z_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(T^2)","display":false},{"tex":"Z_m\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Y_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal P(T^2)\\;\n\\bigl(X\\subseteq Y\\Rightarrow\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(X)\\subseteq\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(Y)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nY_{\\mathcal C,n}^{m}\\subseteq Y_{\\mathcal C,n+1}^{m}\\subseteq U_{\\mathcal C},\n\\qquad\n\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(Z_m)=Z_m.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall W\\in\\mathcal P(T^2)\\;\n\\bigl(\\Phi_{\\mathcal C}^{m}(W)\\subseteq W\\Rightarrow Z_m\\subseteq W\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2341,"backlinks":[{"id":"b1c8fb0e112e49fa","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书给normal类的递归，并指明另外两类类似；此处在一个明确接口中写出join和normal两类。有限条件列表保证有限见证性质；最小不动点论证见 [[56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points]]。本文件不直接用最终关系循环定义自身。原有半等式节点保持其原接口。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-285","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points.md]]"},{"id":"096b350f2180027d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["b1c8fb0e112e49fa"]}